{"version":1,"content":"<p>前廣州市委書記郭永航今年3月落馬。</p><p>中紀委今天宣布，將他開除黨籍、公職，移交司法，並且公布其罪狀，包括大搞權錢交易，無償接受私營企業主提供的高端醫療服務。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T09:00:54.163847+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":77,"images":0,"source":"明報 中國","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T06:42:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T05:19:00.801430+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T08:58:11.289746+00:00","content_hash":"c5c8bcd5848cec14d2101bb4633e961d95fc41349539eb8bfd743a81d972fe48","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}